# The public copy (github.com/Mikale4/ff7-recreation, played at mikale4.github.io/ff7-recreation) holds only this
# recreation's own work: the code, the 3D models and the menu portraits rendered from them. Nothing from the original
# game goes in: its music (bgm/), sound effects (sfx/), movies (assets/movies/) and effect textures (assets/fx/) stay on
# this PC only, as do the reference rips (references/), the saves (saves/) and the working files (docs/, previews/).
# An allow-list: everything is left out unless named below.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/index.html
!/README.md
!/css/
!/js/
!/tools/
!/assets/
/assets/*
!/assets/portraits/
/assets/portraits/ps1_*
/assets/portraits/_*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
